    "body": "I've really enjoyed your plugins. I have previously been using Plenary's testing harness but I'm starting to play with `mini.test` and noticed a typo in the example as I was going through things. `mini.test` looks really nice so far!\r\n\r\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)",
